      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\begin{cases}-10x-22y=-16,\\\\↵10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在将两个方程相加，得到方程 $-29y=58$，其中 $x$ 的系",
        "数等于零。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用方程 $-29y=58$ 代替原方程组的第一个方程，得到新",
        "方程组：",
        "$\\begin{cases}-29y=58,\\\\↵10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从方程 $-29y=58$ 得到：$y=-2$。将 $y=-2$ 代入第二",
        "个方程，解得 $x=6$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "答：$\\{(6,-2)\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 3. 解方程组：",
        "$\\begin{cases}9x+7y=7,\\\\↵2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将第一个方程各项乘以 $3$，第二个方程各项乘以 $7$：",
        "$\\begin{cases}27x+21y=21,\\\\↵14x-21y=-595.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将两个方程相加，得",
        "$\\begin{cases}41x=-574,\\\\↵2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得：",
        "$\\begin{cases}x=-14,\\\\↵2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从后一个方程组求得：$y=19$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "答：$\\{(-14,19)\\}$。"
      ]
    },
